docker run --rm --network none --read-only --memory 2g --cpus 2 --pids-limit 128 sovereign-doc-worker:dev 
    This runs the container with:
    - No network access.
    - A read-only root filesystem.
    - A 2 GB memory limit and 2 CPU limit.
    - A process limit.



